1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,820
I can tell you about her.

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:06,301
I can tell you everything
I know about this place.

3
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:10,473
I don't know if you'll believe
me, but it's worth a shot.

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,440
Go on, then.

5
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:22,820
However, if I detect even a trace of deceit
in your words, I shall end your life.

6
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:03,277
I'm going to break your time.

7
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,780
I'm going to be ready for the time.

8
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,880
I'm not going to have
to break up the window.

9
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:16,517
Now, let's break out any
of the power of this.

10
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,437
I'm going to have a strong feeling.

11
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:23,237
And the heart of this dream
is not going to change it.

12
00:01:23,320 --> 00:01:24,617
We don't have any pain.

13
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,757
See

14
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:32,840
you

15
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:35,080
next time.

16
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,360
What are you doing?

17
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:09,020
I knew I'd find you boys goofing off.

18
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,140
Tonkii it.

19
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,760
Oh, hi, Alice.

20
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,817
Did your sacred arts
class let out early today?

21
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:21,400
Because, like, you're Integrity
Knight Alice Synthesis 30.

22
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:22,857
I'm not early at all.

23
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:25,500
But your real name is Alice Zuburg.

24
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:28,580
Your dad's the elder of Real.

25
00:02:30,340 --> 00:02:33,752
I heard you were good at sacred
arts and cooking as a kid.

26
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:39,500
Alice, your cooking keeps
getting better. For real.

27
00:02:40,620 --> 00:02:41,620
Oh, I don't know.

28
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:43,780
It turned out okay, I guess.

29
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,725
But it could have been better.

30
00:02:48,900 --> 00:02:50,120
Eight years ago,

31
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,937
you and this boy who was
your best friend went to

32
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:56,020
the End Mountains to get
some ice for your village.

33
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,840
On the way out, you took the wrong tunnel.

34
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:03,850
There it is!

35
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:20,437
Where are we?

36
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:24,180
The Dark Territory.

37
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:30,340
You came out where the Taboo
Index forbids everyone from going.

38
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:32,700
The Dark Territory.

39
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:56,120
No, wait!

40
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,460
Alice!

41
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:26,271
All you did was touch the ground in the
Dark Territory with your fingertips.

42
00:04:27,420 --> 00:04:29,917
But no one can violate the Taboo Index.

43
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,500
Not even by mistake.

44
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:35,860
Your daughter, Alice Zuburg,
has disobeyed the Taboo Index.

45
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:40,520
I shall take her with me to answer
for her crimes and be executed.

46
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,840
Don't just stand there! Go help her!

47
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,200
Yu-Gi-Oh!

48
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:15,060
Get these guys off me!

49
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,300
Come on, hurry!

50
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:17,700
Yu-Gi-Oh!

51
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:38,380
You were taken to Senator by an
Integrity Knight called Tiese Elbert.

52
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:41,388
No one knew what happened
to you after that.

53
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,440
Alice! Yes!

54
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:53,521
Well, actually, someone used to bring me
my lunch every day, but that was years ago.

55
00:05:53,860 --> 00:05:54,690
Oh, well.

56
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,660
So why'd they stop?

57
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,720
She was my childhood friend.

58
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,620
She was the same age as me.

59
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:10,400
When we were little, we
played together all the time.

60
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:16,200
And after I received my calling, she would
bring me lunch every day without fail.

61
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:21,400
But then, because of me...

62
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:24,857
That boy who was your best
friend, his name's Eugeo,

63
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:27,705
and his calling was to
cut down the Giga Cedar.

64
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:31,154
It was his idea to find you
and bring you back to Rulid.

65
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,860
I'm scared.

66
00:06:39,780 --> 00:06:40,610
What?

67
00:06:40,693 --> 00:06:42,120
I can't just stand here.

68
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:45,784
I can't make the same
mistake I made with Alice.

69
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,640
When Tiese Elbrick came to take you,

70
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:51,694
Eugeo wanted to stop him, but he froze.

71
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:54,805
The guilt's been eating
away at him ever since.

72
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:56,230
Die!

73
00:06:56,880 --> 00:06:57,820
Get him down!

74
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:03,300
It's time!

75
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,460
I'll fight!

76
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:12,180
And protect my friends!

77
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:15,720
Run, Yu-Gi-Oh!

78
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:23,400
Yu-Gi-Oh!

79
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,660
Yu-Gi-Oh!

80
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,240
Yu-Gi-Oh!

81
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,900
Hang on, Yu-Gi-Oh! Please!

82
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,180
We made a promise.

83
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,240
You, me, and Alice.

84
00:07:52,940 --> 00:07:56,320
We promised we'd protect each other.

85
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:59,280
I couldn't six years ago.

86
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:06,820
But now, finally, I got to.

87
00:08:12,580 --> 00:08:16,857
Eugeo figured if he was going to bring
you back home, he'd have to get stronger.

88
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:19,240
So he decided to be a swordsman.

89
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,980
Hey, look it! And what?

90
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:05,541
After seven years of chopping away at the
Giga Cedar, Eugeo had finally cut it down.

91
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,294
That's how he got to pick
swordsmen for his new calling.

92
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,360
Well then, are you ready?

93
00:09:12,980 --> 00:09:13,810
Uh-huh.

94
00:09:13,893 --> 00:09:16,780
He left Rulid for Senator,
and I went with him.

95
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:24,320
It took a while, but we got
into the Swordcraft Academy.

96
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:28,140
We had good mentors there,
and learned a ton from them.

97
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,317
Academy right here.

98
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,812
The plan was to become Integrity Knights.

99
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,400
Get inside the Central

100
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:39,637
Cathedral, find you, and bring you home.

101
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,277
First things first, though.

102
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,880
We have to ace this exam.

103
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:46,217
Only the top 12 will get to advance.

104
00:09:46,300 --> 00:09:49,420
After we became Elite
Disciples, we had to deal with

105
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,277
something we weren't prepared for.

106
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:56,157
Eugeo's page, Tise, and my page, Ronie.

107
00:09:56,240 --> 00:10:01,960
They were taken taken prisoner by two
bastards from noble families, Umber and Rios.

108
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:07,540
Yu-Gi-Oh went to their room to
confront them and save the girls.

109
00:10:10,420 --> 00:10:13,080
Such is my sovereign right!

110
00:10:14,980 --> 00:10:20,160
Stop your squirming and take your punishment
like a good girl. Leave him alone!

111
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,988
Hold your ground, commoner!

112
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:27,760
Rios ordered Yu-Gi-Oh not to move,
And he was frozen on the spot.

113
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:32,380
He had to stand there and watch
as those two assaulted the girls.

114
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,697
And the only reason he
was powerless to help?

115
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:41,300
Was because the Taboo Index says commoners
have to obey a nobleman's orders.

116
00:10:42,940 --> 00:10:48,260
It's a stupid law that's planted in the
souls of every person in the human empire.

117
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,680
No one can defy it.

118
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:55,060
If upholding laws like
these is my duty, then...

119
00:10:55,620 --> 00:10:58,300
And then I...

120
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,310
I...

121
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:16,080
What's going on?

122
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:19,060
Wait, this happened before.

123
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,397
This is evil.

124
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,860
I have to...

125
00:11:28,740 --> 00:11:29,920
Stop them!

126
00:11:31,220 --> 00:11:33,280
Help us! Please!

127
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:34,710
Yen-Yen!

128
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:45,800
Instead of standing there helpless,

129
00:11:46,780 --> 00:11:52,777
and obeying the taboo index, laws that
kept him from saving people he cared about?

130
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:55,960
He chose to do what's
right and fought back.

131
00:12:14,140 --> 00:12:17,800
That piece of junk will shatter
against my secret technique!

132
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,315
We'll see about that!

133
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,780
Well now, how is that?

134
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,500
You can't possibly have thought I,

135
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:49,920
Royos Antinus, would struggle
against a pissant like you!

136
00:12:57,320 --> 00:13:18,515
Kirito...

137
00:13:18,598 --> 00:13:19,428
I cut Rios' arms off, because
I was protecting Eugeo.

138
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:23,400
But the Taboo Index X forbids
killing another human,

139
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:25,739
or even taking part in their death.

140
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:29,041
So, Yu-Gi-Oh and I were arrested.

141
00:13:29,980 --> 00:13:34,400
I am the Integrity Knight who
oversees the capital of Senator.

142
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:46,960
I am Alice Synthesis 30.

143
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,780
Alice, it's you, isn't it?

144
00:13:56,960 --> 00:14:02,280
In a weird twist of fate, the Integrity
Knight they sent to arrest us was you.

145
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,660
I was kind of shocked.

146
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:08,607
You were nothing like the girl
Eugeo was always talking about.

147
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:11,220
You are in violation of the Taboo Index.

148
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:16,520
I will take you into custody, then
question you, then execute you.

149
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:19,837
You've only been here
for a day and a half.

150
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:23,508
After that, you tossed us in
the Central Cathedral's dungeon.

151
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:29,440
Then we broke out and came face to face
with another Integrity Knight, Eldriang.

152
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:31,500
System call.

153
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,200
Enhance armament.

154
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,340
Don't sweat it.

155
00:14:36,460 --> 00:14:38,320
A whip can only reach so far.

156
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,040
We're safe here.

157
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:56,700
Release Recollection.

158
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:06,367
And fighting him, we got a taste of the
secret skills of you Integrity Knights.

159
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:09,580
Perfect weapon control and memory release.

160
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:13,640
No wonder Lady Alice was wary of you.

161
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:18,440
Your attacks have no pattern, which
is surprising and slightly irritating.

162
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:22,317
The only way we survived
Eldrie is because we

163
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:25,459
stumbled on another secret
of the Integrity Knights.

164
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:33,510
What's that?

165
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:40,760
I bet Alice got one of those, too, when
they blocked her memory and changed her.

166
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:46,214
But then, Tiese Elbert showed up, and
we had to get the hell out of there.

167
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:51,340
Attempting an Integrity Knight to fall
from grace is unforgivable, you wretches.

168
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:55,480
I shall pin you down, then
return you to your cell.

169
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:57,640
This way!

170
00:16:01,220 --> 00:16:02,600
Dead end up ahead!

171
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:03,820
What do we do?

172
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,550
Hey!

173
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,280
Over here!

174
00:16:07,920 --> 00:16:08,840
Follow her.

175
00:16:18,220 --> 00:16:19,400
Where are we?

176
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:23,591
Now they know we're here.

177
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,958
We can't use this back door anymore.

178
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:30,620
We'd be dead if it wasn't for Cardinal.

179
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,532
She's the caretaker of the Great Library.

180
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:37,537
She's the one who told me all
the secrets of this world.

181
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:38,450
Thank you.

182
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:40,480
Come with me.

183
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,100
I'll try to be as succinct as possible.

184
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:48,370
System call.

185
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:50,920
Generate luminous element.

186
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:54,100
Form element. Liquid shape.

187
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:05,080
She told about how a simple girl
named Quinella became administrator,

188
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:07,740
the pontifex of the Axiom Church.

189
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:11,580
Through the Synthesis Ritual,

190
00:17:11,840 --> 00:17:16,977
this man will be reborn as a
warrior devoted only to me,

191
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:18,920
my Integrity Knight.

192
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:22,837
She also told me how
you knights are made by

193
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:25,861
sealing away your memories
and planting fake ones.

194
00:17:26,340 --> 00:17:27,940
And how do I do that?

195
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:30,597
Simply remove the piety module.

196
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:33,209
All the knights have
one in their forehead.

197
00:17:33,700 --> 00:17:38,700
When Eugeo had a chance to ask her something,
he asked how to get your memory back.

198
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,760
And then, to get to you,

199
00:17:42,100 --> 00:17:45,688
we had to fight our way through
a bunch of Integrity Knights.

200
00:17:46,280 --> 00:17:47,200
No bear!

201
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:48,680
I can't...

202
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:59,320
Don't worry, I won't kill you.

203
00:17:59,620 --> 00:18:01,740
I'm gonna teach you a lesson today.

204
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:04,457
You're gonna watch these
knights you made fun

205
00:18:04,540 --> 00:18:07,364
of fight and see what
real strength's all about.

206
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:19,200
You didn't come this far because you
hated the Integrity Knights, did you?

207
00:18:19,820 --> 00:18:21,920
You're here to get Alice back.

208
00:18:22,540 --> 00:18:24,481
You're here because you love her.

209
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:25,620
But guess what?

210
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:30,220
That Integrity Knight, she feels
just as strong about her duty.

211
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,777
And I'm no different.

212
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:34,440
I want to protect everyone in this world.

213
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:38,900
You, Alice, even this night.

214
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:43,260
We're so close, and we
can't afford to give up now.

215
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:47,740
Ain't that right, Yu-Gi-Oh?

216
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:58,200
We made it all the way up to the 80th
floor, and that's where we found you.

217
00:18:58,800 --> 00:19:00,720
I shall eliminate you.

218
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:06,599
Enhance armaments!

219
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:16,040
He went for my sword!

220
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:20,714
We thought we had a good plan, but
you were stronger than the both of us.

221
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:25,960
Now here we are, on the
wall outside the cathedral.

222
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:34,237
Ha, ha, ha.

223
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,555
Come and get it, kid.

224
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:41,060
I bet Eugeo's fighting his way
up right now, looking for you.

225
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:55,880
Blue Rose Sword, lend me your power!

226
00:19:57,200 --> 00:19:58,435
Release Recollection!

227
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:08,833
That's it, but there's one
last thing I have to tell you.

228
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:14,052
Soon, everything in this world
is going to come to an end.

229
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:20,745
Cardinal told me it's about to enter its
final phase, and there's no stopping it.

230
00:20:21,540 --> 00:20:24,940
The day when the Dark Territory
invades the human empire.

231
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:29,157
Cardinal's job is to make sure
there's balance in this world,

232
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:32,060
and she told me she
didn't accept its fate.

233
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:38,957
She believes the only way to
restore balance to the underworld

234
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:43,520
now is to wipe the slate clean
and return it to nothing.

235
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:54,100
So this is it.

236
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:59,100
Now I see this is what
it means to be human.

237
00:21:05,460 --> 00:21:06,617
To be held.

238
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:09,397
It's so warm and comforting.

239
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:11,637
After 200 years.

240
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:14,037
This makes the wait worth it.

241
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,297
To think something so simple!

242
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:18,120
Could be so satisfying.

243
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:21,580
The wait was more than worth it.

244
00:21:23,320 --> 00:21:25,657
She's not looking forward
to what she has to do.

245
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:26,977
She's got a heart.

246
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:28,240
I know that.

247
00:21:32,160 --> 00:21:34,957
System call I told her
that once we made it

248
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:37,257
through the nights and
took administrator down.

249
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:42,920
Once and for all I'd figure out a way to
save this world and all the people in it.

250
00:21:45,840 --> 00:21:50,240
That's pretty much everything I
know and what I know to be true.

251
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:54,277
You can believe it or not!

252
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:58,040
If you do and you want
to save this world and?

253
00:21:58,820 --> 00:21:59,702
everyone in it.

254
00:22:00,140 --> 00:22:02,940
